@settings
subtitle: Enable or disable various features, including altHistory options.

For other, non-difficulty related tweaks.

- @enable_sandbox: Enable sandbox
- @disable_sandbox: Disable sandbox
- @ebert_lives: Ebert lives... for a little longer.
- @ebert_lives_undo: Ebert does not live a little longer.
- @president_marx: Marx is President.
- @president_marx_undo: Marx is not President.
- @1924_start: Proceed to 1924 start menu
- @1928_start: Proceed to 1928 start menu
- @1931_start: Proceed to 1931 start menu

@enable_sandbox
subtitle: Enables the Sandbox Pinned Card - allowing you to alter various ganeplay elements
view-if: sandbox_enabled = 0
on_arrival: sandbox_enabled = 1
go-to: settings

The Sandbox card has been enabled. Enjoy!

@disable_sandbox
subtitle: Disenables the Sandbox Pinned Card - disallowing you to alter various ganeplay elements
view-if: sandbox_enabled = 1
on_arrival: sandbox_enabled = 0
go-to: settings

The Sandbox card has been disabled.

